// A typographic single quote is deleted before the rank.
// An ASCII apostrophe stays deleted. A double quote stays a separator.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE apos ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG apos law

IMPULSE apos 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "apos" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
